      "ai_summary_en": "Kissei announced publication of phase 3 BOND-003 cohort C results for the oncolytic-virus candidate CG0070 in The Lancet Oncology on August 17. The single-arm study involves BCG-unresponsive non-muscle-invasive bladder cancer with carcinoma in situ. Publication is not comparative proof of superiority or regulatory approval. Kissei holds relevant exclusive rights in 20 Asian countries and territories excluding China; a Japanese filing remained a future step in the announcement."
